SECTION 2257 COMPLIANCE MADE EASY! 

This productivity app is designed to allow producers of certain erotic-themed images or video to easily compile, store, and transmit model age and information records required by U.S. law. Performers, photographers, website operators and others involved in the production of such material must generate legal records containing specific categories of information under Title 18 U.S.C. §§ 2257 & 2257A (“Section 2257”). A copy of the performer’s picture ID card must also be included in the records. Some online platforms also require a written record of consent by the performer to be depicted on a specific website or account.

Quick 2257® allows you to:

• Create a form containing the performer’s legal name, stage names, and/or aliases;
• Record the date of original production of the depiction;
• Identify the title of the work associated with the depiction;
• Capture the performer’s picture ID card and verification photo on the mobile device; 
• Sign and verify the accuracy of the information using the touch screen;

• Create a written, signed consent form authorizing publication of the depiction;

• Compile all information into convenient .pdf forms; and,
• Store the records on the device or email them to the records custodian.

Developed by Lawrence G. Walters, Esq., First Amendment attorney and inventor of other technology designed for the online entertainment industry, this app streamlines the process of generating and transmitting Section 2257 records and consent forms. Anyone involved in the production of erotic material can now quickly compile, store, and transmit the mandatory performer records using this simple mobile app.

Calculation of Orders for customers based on the Price list of your business.

Orders can be sent by email/WhatsApp/Telegram/iMessage/to the printer.

It works together with a free application for customers iZ:Client:
- The price list can be downloaded from the iZ and opened in the  iZ:Client;
- Orders that customers form in their application are opened in the iZ;
- File sharing is carried out by all available communication applications-email/iMessage/telegram/whatsapp
Link iZ:Client: https://apps.apple.com/us/app/iзаказ-клиент/id840053975#?platform=iphone

The data is stored in Apple iCloud and the app will work with a single database on all your Apple devices.

Learn more about features:
CUSTOMERS:
- Add new clients, edit contact information;
- Import incoming phone number to create a new client;
- Phone call to the customer from the customer card;
- List of orders by customer in the customer card;
PRICE LIST:
- Add / edit Price List items;
- Divided into Products and Services;
- The Price List can be downloaded from the exchange file (json format);
- You can send the Price List in PDF format and in exchange file format (json) to the printer/email/iMessage/WhatsApp/Telegram, etc.
ORDERS:
- The list of Orders is divided into a selection by period: Today/Week/Month/All;
- From the list of Orders, you can change the date of the document by clicking on the calendar button;
- In the Order, you can specify all the necessary details in the special tab "Order features". In the future, it is planned to filter orders by Features. Thus, you can put labels on orders, for example, specify the City, mark urgent orders, VIP-client, etc.
- Discount to the Order-enter the discount percentage or discount amount and automatically calculate the total amount of the order;
- Orders can be sent by email/WhatsApp/Telegram/iMessage/printer, etc.
- You can import Orders from exchange files (json format)
OVERVIEW:
This is an analytical section on orders for the following periods: Today/Week/Month/All;
- Sales by day;
- Rating by price list positions (the most profitable ones at the top);
SETTINGS:
- Default settings-used to generate printed forms (PDF) of orders; to fill in the parameters of the price list items and create new customers;
- Delete orders-Service processing to delete orders for the specified period;
- Erase all data-Delete all information in the app;
- Order Features-Edit and add new order features;

